      "comment": "BCPush_PoDeliveries - GENERATED by _gen_poreceiving_flows.py; edit that, not this. Deliveries received against POs (crfdf_podelivery) from the Switchboard app's Warehouse Management into BC (LUM PO Delivery, API poDeliveries) - added, edited and removed - for the Purchase Order card and Job Card. See BCPush_PoReceiving.md.",
      "parameters": {
